    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay cool. i'll try the glue then. i'm also a bit worried about tetanus since the tool was pretty old and rusty. do i really need to go get a shot for that or can i just take some extra antibiotics to cover my bases? i'm trying to avoid the clinic if i can.",
